        language:"dowe"
        variant:"soft"
        scheme:"surface"
        copyLabel:"Copy structure"
        copiedLabel:"Copied"
        content:"""
          .dowe/dist/docker/
            Dockerfile
            deploy.json
            dowe-app
          .dowe/dist/web/docker/
            Dockerfile
            deploy.json
            dowe-app
        """
  Section id:"deploy-runtime" p:{ xs:5 md:7 }
    Grid columns:1 gap:5
      Grid columns:1 gap:3
        Text size:"xs" weight:"bold" spacing:"widest" color:"muted"
          "6 / DISTROLESS / NONROOT"
        Title size:"3xl" weight:"black"
          "Ship one Dowe application, not the toolchain"
        Text size:"sm" color:"muted"
          "Server and Web each contain one standalone Linux application executable with their selected surface embedded. Neither image contains Cargo, rustc, a shell, or Node.js."
